---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我们" description="关于资源分享站的介绍">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    <article class="space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-light rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <span class="text-3xl">📦</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-title">关于资源分享站</h1>
        <p class="text-text-muted mt-2">分享优质资源，助力学习成长</p>
      </div>
      
      <section class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-title mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🎯</span>
          <span>我们的使命</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          资源分享站致力于收集和分享各类优质资源，包括绿化软件、影视动漫、PC工具、游戏资源和实用教程。我们相信知识和资源应该自由共享，帮助更多人提升自己，实现个人成长和价值。
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <section class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-title mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>📁</span>
          <span>资源分类</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
          <div class="bg-success/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">💻</div>
            <div class="font-medium text-text-title text-sm">绿化软件</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">免安装软件合集</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-purple/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🎬</div>
            <div class="font-medium text-text-title text-sm">影视动漫</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">高清影视资源</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-blue/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🛠️</div>
            <div class="font-medium text-text-title text-sm">PC工具</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">实用工具软件</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-amber/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🎮</div>
            <div class="font-medium text-text-title text-sm">游戏相关</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">游戏资源分享</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📚</div>
            <div class="font-medium text-text-title text-sm">实用教程</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">学习教程分享</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔗</div>
            <div class="font-medium text-text-title text-sm">外站导航</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">优质网站推荐</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <section class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-title mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>⚠️</span>
          <span>免责声明</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="text-text-body text-sm space-y-2">
          <p>本站资源均来自互联网，仅供学习交流使用，版权归原作者所有。</p>
          <p>下载后请在24小时内删除，请勿用于商业用途。</p>
          <p>如有侵权，请联系我们删除相关内容。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <section class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-title mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>📧</span>
          <span>联系我们</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="text-text-body space-y-2">
          <p>邮箱：contact@example.com</p>
          <p>如有任何问题或建议，欢迎随时联系我们！</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
